/// struct drm_gem_open - Argument for &DRM _IOCTL_GEM_OPEN ioctl. : Returned handle for the object. : Returned size of the object Open an object using the global name, returning a handle and the size. This handle (of course) holds a reference to the object, so the object will not go away until the handle is deleted.
